OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos-hit beach set to remain
OL,4,Ashut for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said regular clean-ups would also
OL,7,Fneed to take place at nearby Teats Hill
OL,8,Fbeach and Clovelly Bay, after
OL,9,F"asbestos-containing material" was
OL,10,Ffound in concrete there. Those beaches,
OL,11,Fhowever, remain open and pose low risk
OL,12,Fto public health, officials said.
